<title>FRANCE: Eiffage to sell one bln Ffr of assets.</title>
<headline>Eiffage to sell one bln Ffr of assets.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Public works group Eiffage said on Monday that it planned to sell around one billion francs of non-strategic assets beginning this year.</p>
<p>It announced the plan in its first-half results statement in which it reported a net attributable loss of 890 million francs, forecast a full-year loss, and suspended its 1996 dividend.</p>
<p>It said its 1997 recovery programme would include &quot;a programme of sales of assets of non-strategic units for an overall sum of one billion francs that would get under way in 1996&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom, +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
